          </briefdescription>
          <detaileddescription>
<para>Fix up is VK_PPC_GOT_TPREL_PCREL MO_GOT_TPREL_PCREL_FLAG = MO_GOT_FLAG | MO_TPREL_FLAG | MO_PCREL_FLAG, </para>
